{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 34","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_34\">Problem 34</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 34\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/0/950700ebd46b601b464f9afb4839522e44b15640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{equals 0.33333333}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{is less than 0.33333333 by }\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 10^8}\\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{is less than 0.33333333 by }\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 10^9}\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{is greater than 0.33333333 by }\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 10^8}\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{is greater than 0.33333333 by }\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 10^9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"475\" height=\"151\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f9f2ed2b681d938be1a6033bb24871ff69655f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{33333333}{10^8}-\\frac{1}{3}\\implies \\frac{3\\cdot 10^7+3\\cdot 10^6+\\dots+3\\cdot 10^0}{10^8}-\\frac{1}{3}\\implies\\frac{3(10^{8}-1)}{9\\cdot 10^{8}}-\\frac{1}{3}\\implies\\frac{10^8-1}{3\\cdot 10^8}-\\frac{1}{3}\\implies\\frac{10^8}{3\\cdot 10^8}-\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 10^8}-\\frac{1}{3}\\implies\\frac{-1}{3\\cdot 10^8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"1061\" height=\"41\" />\nBecause we did <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b1086b330757709027556b9355d59e75ec0f62b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.33333333-\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"115\" height=\"38\" />, it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME\" title=\"1954 AHSME\">1954 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1954 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1954\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">Problem 33</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">Problem 35</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:ce